## Technical Implementation

| Component | Details |
|-----------|---------|
| **Mode** | Server (full) |
| **Optimization Method** | Dual Optuna (separate for LogReg + SVM) — Bayesian hyperparameter search |
| **Feature Extraction** | Topological Data Analysis (TDA) with persistent homology |
| **Cross-Validation** | Subject-based Leave-One-Subject-Out (LOSO) |
| **Priority Metric** | F2 Score (β=2, emphasizes recall over precision) |
| **Evaluation Modes** | Naive (repeated CV), General (LOSO), Personalized (per-subject repeated CV) |
| **Statistics** | Mean ± 95% CI via t-test for Naive and Personal metrics |
| **Parallel Processing** | 15 model jobs per optimization trial |
| **Feature Dimensions** | 24-dimensional topological feature vectors |

